 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Say your name",
   "texto": [
    "**Nama saya Sari** literally means «My name, Sari» and is naturally translated as «My name is Sari.» or «soy Sari». No need to add a verb «be».",
    "**Saya** is neutral or courteous «I»; **aku**, reliable «I». For «you / you», **kamu** is informal and **Anda** is more formal. They are not exact equivalencies: depending on the situation, the name or treatment is also used."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Ask and say where you're from",
   "texto": [
    "**Siapa nama Anda?** asks the name; **Anda dari mana?**, where is the other person from. In the response, **Saya dari Spanyol** is equivalent to «I'm from Spain.». The questions do not have signs of opening."
   ]
  },
